menu "Gate simulator (HIL)"

config GATE_SIM
    bool "Enable hardware-in-the-loop simulator"
    default n
    help
        Runs gate_logic/motor_drv/etc against virtual peripherals:
        USB-UART REPL (status/btn/limit/enc/i/mains/fault) plus the
        Wi-Fi web dashboard. Intended for the bare devkit board with
        nothing wired. NEVER enable in a build that drives real mains.

endmenu
